  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve01",
      "hash64": "56B8FBC8C1F1307B",
      "text": "我的寶貝不管在哪裡\\n都能立刻說睡就睡。\\c\\n牠是在用寶可夢的招式「睡覺」\\n來回復體力嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve03",
      "hash64": "56B8FDC8C1F133E1",
      "text": "販賣部超方便的！\\n而且要到街上去買東西實在太麻煩了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve06",
      "hash64": "56B900C8C1F138FA",
      "text": "之前我正要捉寶可夢的時候，\\n因為沒有球結果讓牠給逃走了！\\r\\n我還是多買一些好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve07",
      "hash64": "56B901C8C1F13AAD",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve08",
      "hash64": "56B8F2C8C1F12130",
      "text": "現烤出爐的麵包香噴噴！\\n就這麼上鉤真不甘心，但我還是要買！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve09",
      "hash64": "56B8F3C8C1F122E3",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳喜歡麵包？\\n我是飯糰派的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
