      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni04",
      "hash64": "686AA935F8946BE7",
      "text": "我看看，\\n我要買傷藥、解毒藥和解麻藥……\\r\\n解凍藥是不是也需要呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni05",
      "hash64": "686AA835F8946A34",
      "text": "我來買能和寶可夢一起吃的宵夜。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
